rkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7218302","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":7218302,"initDialog":721830201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[2093],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Inazuma_72183/Q7218302","priority":5,"questId":72183,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":721830201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":1670615722,"text":"Hmm? Hello children, are you here to see me?","nextNodeIds":[721830202]},{"nodeId":721830202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3641869042,"text":"About the Naku Weed seeds...","nextNodeIds":[721830203]},{"nodeId":721830203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":541485738,"text":"Seeds... Ah, so you'd like to grow these seeds in the Serenitea Pot?","nextNodeIds":[721830204]},{"nodeId":721830204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":1724428154,"text":"I suppose that's no problem. The Serenitea Pot is your little realm, after all.","nextNodeIds":[721830205]},{"nodeId":721830205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":2827207874,"text":"It's just that you've only brought this bag of seeds today. Are you only planning to plant this one bag of seeds?","nextNodeIds":[721830206]},{"nodeId":721830206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3078906346,"text":"Oh, that's right! We don't even know how to collect seeds...","nextNodeIds":[721830207]},{"nodeId":721830207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1228250866,"text":"After we plant this bag of seeds, where do we go to find more...","nextNodeIds":[721830208]},{"nodeId":721830208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":2964810378,"text":"There, there, don't worry. I happen to have a little box here that I used many years ago.","nextNodeIds":[721830209]},{"nodeId":721830209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":931038626,"text":"When I used to plant flowers, they were all kept in this little box. The flowers grown in the box can be preserved for a long time.","nextNodeIds":[721830210]},{"nodeId":721830210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":1777011786,"text":"Moreover, after putting the flowers in the box, it can produce several flower seeds... This makes sowing them very convenient indeed.","nextNodeIds":[721830211]},{"nodeId":721830211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":2969211362,"text":"Although this box is somewhat less useful now... but it still retains the power to \"generate seeds.\"","nextNodeIds":[721830212]},{"nodeId":721830212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":2284843754,"text":"Hmm... I don't use it much now anyway... So, why don't I give it to you?","nextNodeIds":[721830213]},{"nodeId":721830213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":1419428386,"text":"This box should come in handy, whether you want to grow some flowers and plants, or some crops.","nextNodeIds":[721830214]},{"nodeId":721830214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1743736754,"text":"Thank you, Granny!","nextNodeIds":[721830215]},{"nodeId":721830215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":644535386,"text":"Thank you, Granny!","nextNodeIds":[721830216]},{"nodeId":721830216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2093,"speakerName":"Madame Ping","textMapHash":2799548634,"text":"Oh children, you don't have to be so polite. Go ahead and give it a try, but I must say that it's not an easy task to take care of flowers and plants, so you should be prepared.","nextNodeIds":[721830217]},{"nodeId":721830217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2983608906,"text":"Granny is really powerful indeed... but before we try that box out, let's go back to our teapot and try to sow those seeds.","nextNodeIds":[721830218]},{"nodeId":721830218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3463607442,"text":"Hmm, Paimon really hopes that they'll grow soon...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7218302,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["100966","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_DEL_PACK_ITEM"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["2093"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7218301,7218302],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3098,"speakerName":"Madarame Hyakubei","count":13},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","spe